### Register a new user
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "test1234"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:3001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "test1234"
}

### Create a task (replace eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MSwiaWF0IjoxNzczNjk4MzU4LCJleHAiOjE3NzQzMDMxNTh9.uBc2aWIteCQhLwu9dx7CgbDrLefY_fLmP25OwsQVF4Q after logging in)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MSwiaWF0IjoxNzczNjk4MzU4LCJleHAiOjE3NzQzMDMxNTh9.uBc2aWIteCQhLwu9dx7CgbDrLefY_fLmP25OwsQVF4Q

{
  "title": "Finish HCI proposal",
