### Edit a task (replace 1 with task id)
PATCH http://localhost:3001/api/tasks/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6MSwiaWF0IjoxNzczNjk4MzU4LCJleHAiOjE3NzQzMDMxNTh9.uBc2aWIteCQhLwu9dx7CgbDrLefY_fLmP25OwsQVF4Q

